Release 0.2.0.

Changelog: 17-10-2026 14:10:30

Fixed. The app's folder in the suite is apps/overlay (was apps/system-overlay) and its package is system_overlay
(was bc250_overlay): the suite's naming convention (owner, 17-10-2026), a short folder name and the package named
after the app; both names are the owner's. With the folder go its key in the portal, its chapter of the wiki
(apps/overlay/), its installer test and its release tags: overlay-v<x.y.z> from the next release on, which the
app's update check follows. The installed app keeps its name, its launcher bc250-system-overlay, its folder under
~/.local/share (an install replaces the whole app folder there, so no old package folder stays behind) and its
settings; the portal moves its record of the installed copy to the new key.

